sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Mobile Client
    participant G as Google OAuth
    participant A as MyVanitys API

    C->>G: Redirect user to Google consent screen
    G-->>C: Redirect back with authorization code
    C->>A: POST /auth/google  { code }
    A->>G: Exchange authorization code for tokens + profile
    G-->>A: Profile (Google id, email, name)

    alt Google account NOT registered
        A-->>C: 401 ProblemDetail (Authorization Error)
        Note over C: Prompt the user to register first.
    else Registered account
        A-->>C: 200 AuthResponse  { token, userId, email, name }
        Note over C: Send the token as "Authorization: Bearer <token>" on protected requests.
    end
